abstract: "Training-free Mixture of Scars (MoS: canonical Block-64 INT4 bases + Activation-Aware SVD scar experts + fused Apple Metal & NVIDIA CUDA Triton W4A16+ASVD kernels) and SCache O(1) (Widrow-Hoff Delta fast weights + synchronized 32-token micro-page routing). Includes public zero-login downloadable 70B-class checkpoint (Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct MoS v2, 72.71B, 38.12 GiB via mos-run --download) and step-by-step Practical Local Deployment Guide (docs/GUIA_PRATICO_MOS_SCACHE_72B.md)."
